From ada4c6d3d42161aaaac04ecab2fbc355fcbaa532 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lars Wikman <lars@underjord.io>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 15:31:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Inject raw input into a running renderer
 (EmergeSkia.inject_input/2)

A renderer only took input from its own backend (and the test harness had its
own cursor NIF). renderer_inject_input decodes the raw input terms the renderer
emits and sends them to its event actor, so hit-testing, element events, focus,
scrolling and raw-input delivery work for input received elsewhere, for any
backend including headless. Needs a native rebuild. The macOS host returns
{:error, :unsupported}.
